    "end": 16.0,
    "text": "There's probably a tennis ball around"
  },
  {
    "id": "l3",
    "start": 16.0,
    "end": 20.5,
    "text": "Don't you tell me that you left it in the car"
  },
  {
    "id": "l4",
    "start": 20.5,
    "end": 25.0,
    "text": "I have seen exactly where you are"
  },
  {
    "id": "l5",
